   "versionNonce": 1734348498,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786850903381,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Called in six places: the position\ncache, saving human moves (FC),\nreading human moves (F), saving engine\nscores (EC), creating a node, and once\nat the start of scoring a Black move -\nthat one result is reused through B1\nto B4.\n\nTwo test scripts call it as well.\nNothing else in the app builds\ndatabase keys.",
   "rawText": "Called in six places: the position\ncache, saving human moves (FC),\nreading human moves (F), saving engine\nscores (EC), creating a node, and once\nat the start of scoring a Black move -\nthat one result is reused through B1\nto B4.\n\nTwo test scripts call it as well.\nNothing else in the app builds\ndatabase keys.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "lEdjhDJ8VU5QY2cOfqM3Z",
   "originalText": "Called in six places: the position\ncache, saving human moves (FC),\nreading human moves (F), saving engine\nscores (EC), creating a node, and once\nat the start of scoring a Black move -\nthat one result is reused through B1\nto B4.\n\nTwo test scripts call it as well.\nNothing else in the app builds\ndatabase keys.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
  {
   "id": "EFmbdHc7JAZoAkwicAD1Y",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 340,
   "y": 340,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 220,
   "angle": 0,
